Design choice log: picked Approach 1 (qualified keys for every default
entry) plus a minimal Approach 2 (qualified-only entries for the
multi-version Kinds). Approach 1 alone only qualifies the EXISTING
short-name mapping (V1 GA), so multi-version dispatch still needs the
additional v1beta1/v1beta2/v1alpha3 entries. The combined fix is
strictly more powerful than either alone and addresses both failure
modes the ticket opened with.
